== Effects ==
* +0.3 [[speed]].
* {{dlc|nr}} -4.25 [[range]].
* {{dlc|nr}} +1.5 [[tear falling speed]].
* {{dlc|r}} +2.5 [[range]].
* Decreases Isaac's size, making him less likely to be hit.
* {{transformation contribution|Fun Guy}}

== Notes ==
* This item can rarely drop from destroying [[Rocks#Mushrooms|mushrooms]].
* {{dlc|nr}} Even though the range stat is decreased, the ''effective'' range is slightly increased due to the changes to the hidden tear falling speed attribute.
* Unlike other size downs, the one from Mini Mush is permanent - after taking the item, Isaac's hitbox cannot be increased past 75% of its base value.

== Interactions ==
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|Dr. Fetus}}: Effective range is decreased since tear falling speed does not affect Dr. Fetus.

