== Trivia ==
* This item and its effects are likely a reference to the Mini Mushroom of the [[wikipedia:Super Mario|Super Mario]] series.
* Mini Mush, along with {{i|1up!}}, {{i|Magic Mushroom}}, {{i|Super Bandage}}, and {{i|Mega Mush}} is one of the few items that make a unique sound upon pickup.

